  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-img-element\r\n> Contexts in which this element can be used:\r\n> - Where embedded content is expected.\r\n\r\n　↓\r\n\r\nThe above should be fixed following:\r\n> Contexts in which this element can be used:\r\n> - Where embedded content is expected.\r\n> - **As the last element in a picture element.**\r\n\r\n\r\nRef: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-picture-element\r\n> Content model:\r\n> - Zero or more source elements, followed by one **img** element, optionally intermixed with script-supporting elements.\r\n",
